~I have come to realize something about you, Edwin.~
DO ~SetGlobal("KKEDRomTalk","GLOBAL",25) SetGlobal("KKEDSex","GLOBAL",1) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNavEdTimer","GLOBAL",900)~ 
