== ~KKNavJ~ ~Glad to hear it, I could not take much more of your weeping.~
== EDWINJ ~Edwin Odesseiron never weeps, you sim..er.. woman! I was merely distressed by my dilemma.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~If you say so, I am just glad all is well now. I have to admit, I did miss that handsome face.~
== EDWINJ ~How could you not?~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~Indeed. -There is something we need to talk about.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~We have been though much together. You becoming a woman...~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~I think that experience had a bigger effect on you than you expected, however.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~It affected me, in ways I never could have imagined. I was honestly afraid. Afraid you would remain that way forever.~
== EDWINJ ~The thought had crossed my mind, briefly. But yes, it bothered me.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~Bothered you? You act as if it was minor inconvience! I was afraid I had lost you forever.~ 
== EDWINJ ~What are saying?~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~I love you, Edwin. Tell me honestly, do you have feelings for me?~
== EDWINJ ~If you must know, yes. I realized it when I thought you were going to bed that filthy ape.~
== EDWINJ ~I have never been a nice person. Yes yes I know, you say otherwise. But I want to try, for you.~
DO ~ChangeAlignment("Edwin", NEUTRAL)~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF WEIGHT #-1 ~Global("KKNavarEdwinaDrow","LOCALS",1)~ THEN ~KKNavJ~ NEDrow2
~I have to say, you look very sexy.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarEdwinaDrow","LOCALS",2)~
== EDWINJ ~You think so? I have more curv... NO! This is worse! How much more do I have to endure?~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~You did this to yourself so, you might as well make the most of it.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~It is not so bad, you could always visit the lust chambers while we are here.~
== EDWINJ ~You think we would have time? NO! NO! What am I saying?~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~Maybe they can teach you a few things, incase you return to normal.~
EXIT 